{"text": " Welcome to Welcome to Impesadaraja API. I am so glad you are here. An Nairobi e-commerce startup was losing 35% of sales because customers abandoned checkout when they could not pay with Impesadar. A developer integrated STK push in four days. Check out abandonment dropped to 8%. Revenue increased by KSH 2.4 million in the first month. Impesad integration is not a nice to have for Kenyan businesses. It is the payment system. By the end of this course you will set up Darajas sandbox credentials and make your first authenticated API call in lesson two. You will build a complete STK push flow from initiation through callback to payment confirmation and database record. You will implement C2B for incoming payments and B2C for programmatic disbursements to customers and suppliers. You will handle all Darajas error codes, implement exponential back-off retries and prevent duplicate payments with idempotency keys. And you will deploy a production payment system on railway with full audit logging, receipt generation and a reconciliation report. This course has nine lessons and seven hours of content with five hands-on sandboxes. Your final project is complete Impesad payment system for Duke Asmart, a fictional Kenyan e-commerce platform. You do not need to code. You do not need a technology background. All you need is the willingness to learn and I will guide you every step of the way. Your first task is waiting below. I will see you in lesson one. Your skills bear fruit.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 6.82, "text": " Welcome to Welcome to Impesadaraja API. I am so glad you are here.", "tokens": [50364, 4027, 281, 4027, 281, 8270, 279, 345, 289, 12908, 9362, 13, 286, 669, 370, 5404, 291, 366, 510, 13, 50708], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22481457636906552, "compression_ratio": 1.3806818181818181, "no_speech_prob": 0.029265640303492546, "words": [{"word": " Welcome", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.48, "probability": 0.9037018418312073}, 